# Oxlint Lint & Fix Rule

Whenever you create or modify JavaScript, TypeScript, or Vue files:
1. Run `npx -y oxlint@latest` (or `npx -y oxlint@latest --fix`) immediately after making changes.
2. If any lint errors or warnings are found, inspect the diagnostics and fix them right away.
3. Verify that `npx -y oxlint@latest` passes with 0 errors before concluding the work.
